## Pin (Feature B — generic trait-bound enforcement, point b):
## a `def needs[T: Greet](x: &T)` called with a type that does NOT
## `include Greet` must be rejected with the general E0277
## unsatisfied-bound diagnostic. Mirrors the design's `[T: Display]`
## red case. The bound is checked AFTER `{T -> Plain}` is harvested
## from the call's actual argument.

mixin Greet
  def greet -> String
end

class Greeter
  def init
  end

  include Greet

  def greet -> String
    "hi"
  end
end

class Plain
  def init
  end
end

def needs[T: Greet](x: &T) -> String
  x.greet
end

def main
  let p = Plain.new()
  let _r = needs(&p)
end
